8JHaMzhJb5x-d8V3P5JWU5d99HcjfloulxFUOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFS6ZcWfqNIOhFrthLYscjasSFDiF5CJYEv2S6g_dvkXA&oe=6A734472"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "296114026862324", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_296114030195657_275861733805151497_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qnG3d7mm95QQ7kNvwEtSKbG&_nc_oc=AdpguO7gmmQFKizOBn_mh5sU_uIuD58KlUHhu88-fm4SenuGWbZW9Aur9h5YdEmBg7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHgw50_O3nMMS1aDD5JoJm_KeiVAaCR0Qt9pTTO-mW04A&oe=6A734FA1"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "802537541948419", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210889_802537548615085_7583608226087987807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MOGLBmeHg_QQ7kNvwE9OPbK&_nc_oc=Adr8-SM3rscXP1IytkoZScixTeJENC3wzEFC6bkLDGNPZCKAJOaOOjDfE_EPziAAkQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE3R6F0Qv0G8nB8uJvo6hL5UJk0xb1jnHK12MCBrrE41A&oe=6A73456E"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "1952004381931095", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75298472_1952004385264428_8213665801664121384_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JzRdsypu0zYQ7kNvwGSzJc9&_nc_oc=AdpTYshs7yXGfPpStvbs6ucjm2w90xMo4czMfXK8MbwUEp1L39HdXtw7-2MlqZlfv98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGowFrqOh9bUGkpDb2Jb6xZP-O6dvNaSWhNE4NnddQtIg&oe=6A732B2C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "7841830009239208", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035410_7841830012572541_6800934679758716826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WhxPtZ4rcu8Q7kNvwFrTles&_nc_oc=Adrtvx3nDVc-qjTnpXXXTV-m-YT6sIbpVFZtZ412-izuO7O0vS0E5EpViJ49_Nfxmhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEE0KhKqC5j-M4V4hF68Qp4614Yly__17oVQamIU0cxhw&oe=6A735793"}, "display_name": "Orb Conquest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges.\nGameplay Overview\n\nIn \"Orb Conquest,\" players are transported to a visually stunning, high-tech environment filled with neon-lit paths and mesmerizing graphics. The game mechanics are designed to test and enhance your coordination and problem-solving skills. Each level presents a unique maze-like track, teeming with hurdles that require quick thinking and precise movements to overcome.\nKey Features\n\n    Dynamic Spheres: Master the control of highly responsive spheres, each with unique attributes and abilities that you can unlock and upgrade as you progress.\n\n    Intricate Tracks: Navigate through a variety of complex and beautifully designed tracks. Each track offers different challenges, from narrow passages to moving barriers and beyond.", "short_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SGag2426 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_categ